ss-model Claudia Haro from 1988 to 1992. The couple welcomed a daughter named Tiffany in 1992.\\n\\nDaniel Stern as Marv Murchins\\n\\nDaniel Stern's character may not have succeeded ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"7fd3bb4011823a381d2b4c512861fe4d836d9581533c16cec8b93285676aef39\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"bb6774e1f944669f35da40ce9d26a1090910360e7bd282e498672db686580ffc\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"This Is Us character married three times one child survives\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d95\"},\"ref\":\"d95\",\"snippet\":\" ... The entirety of Community Board 2, which comprises Fort Greene and Brooklyn Heights, had 117,046 inhabitants as of NYC Health's 2018 Community Health Profile, with an average life expectancy of 80.6 years. This is slightly lower than the median life expectancy of 81.2 for ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Greene,_Brooklyn\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d96\"},\"ref\":\"d96\",\"snippet\":\" ... Elsewhere in February, he played the lead in the television films Prince of Bel Air, co-starring with Kirstie Alley, and The Deliberate Stranger, in which he portrayed the real-life serial killer Ted Bundy. With his career blossoming, he played a role in the 1986 theatrical film ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Harmon\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_a